<title>UK: Wuerttemburg Hypo sets 400 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Wuerttemburg Hypo sets 400 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Sal Oppenheim and Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBERGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY  **28.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  101.30    PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> NOTES    **CALLABLE 28.APR.97, WHEN COUPON THEN STEPS UP TO</p>
<p>		4.125 PCT</p>
